@pyq U.P.P.C.S. (Pre) 1994
The strategy adopted under IRDP in the Seventh Plan was :
(a) Adoption of total household approach
(b) Adoption of village approach
(c) Adoption of block approach
(d) Adoption of district approach
@ans (a)
@note The **Integrated Rural Development Programme** (1978-79, nationwide 1980) gave subsidised credit to poor families; in the Seventh Plan it took a **household approach**, aiming to lift a whole family above the poverty line. It merged into **SGSY** in 1999.
@end
