@trap
**Planning = Concurrent List.** **Planning Commission 15 March 1950** (Cabinet resolution); **NDC 6 August 1952**. **NITI Aayog 1 January 2015**, first VC **Arvind Panagariya**; PM is chairman. **Gandhian Plan: Shriman Narayan Agarwal.** **Rolling plan 1978-80** (Myrdal). **1st Harrod-Domar, 2nd Mahalanobis.** Garibi Hatao: **Fifth Plan**. Human development core: **8th**. Social justice and equality: **9th**. Sustainable growth: **12th** (2012-17). **7 plan-free years.** **Yojana: Publications Division.**
@end

@heatmap

@pattern
Planning questions peaked in the 2000s (plan targets and themes). After 2015 the focus moved to **NITI Aayog** (structure, indices, SDGs) and plan-model matches. Expect one question on either the Five Year Plans or NITI Aayog.
@end

